Now, hold on a second.

314
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:18,837
I, for one, don't think we stand a
chance in a fight against dinosaurs.

315
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,637
Cutting through the jungle
in order to get back to the

316
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:23,297
Mary won't do us much good
if we get killed on the way,

317
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:24,210
will it?

318
00:21:24,293 --> 00:21:28,337
What happened to all that brave warrior of
