then I would no longer know who I am.

337
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:49,640
I'm sorry I suspected you
of causing the explosion.

338
00:22:50,620 --> 00:22:52,900
I now know that this was a judgment.

339
00:22:54,560 --> 00:22:58,020
A judgment from Elbath, the god of war.

340
