408
00:27:26,060 --> 00:27:29,300
But I know that I just gotta try.

409
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:35,580
Far through the sea, the great
of paradise, we've got to find.

410
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:40,817
Don't give up, just keep on trying,
and you'll see that you're closer to?

